% ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
% refs.bib - the canonical bibliography for this repository.
%
% CONVENTIONS, enforced by the sieve-paper skill:
%
%  1. Every entry carries an `annotation` field naming THE CLAIM IN THIS REPOSITORY
%     it supports. An entry with no stated purpose is decoration and gets deleted.
%  2. Every entry carries a `verified` field:
%       verified = {yes, <date>}   -- metadata checked against the source
%       verified = {no}            -- from working knowledge; DOI/year/venue UNCHECKED
%     Nothing marked `no` may appear in a submitted manuscript.
%  3. Keys are lowercase author + year + first significant title word.
%  4. This file is the single source of truth for citations. CITATION.cff describes
%     how to cite THE SOFTWARE and mirrors the annotations; it does not compete.
% ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

